# Login Across a Distributed System

A login crosses an API gateway, authentication server, database and audit queue before the client receives a session.

@animate
client: Client
router: Gateway
server: Auth Server
database: Database
queue: Audit Queue

client sends LOGIN to router
router sends VERIFY USER to server
server sends FIND USER to database
database replies USER ROW to server
server sends LOGIN EVENT to queue
queue replies STORED to server
server replies ACCESS TOKEN to router
router replies SESSION to client
@end
